| Jack Glasscock, 31 | SS | Arthur Irwin, 31 |
| Jerry Denny, 30 | 3B | John Irwin, 27 |

[^1]: No relation to the Washington Nationals team of the modern day.

[^2]: The fact that both teams folded was not unusual, as both had been mired in multiple seasons of poor performance.

